# INPUT

## Images, PDFs, and other files
- Translate in prompt submit and the read tool
- Follow each backend's pattern

# CONTROL

## Interrupt and steer
- Cmd+Return sends now, or the next queued item
- Interrupt, recover, then follow up with a user turn
- Alternative: inject after tool results

## /goal [string|file]
- Stop hook blocks until complete
- Covers /loop [time], /wait <N>, /watch todo.md
- Stop guard variant: same cached prefix plus a review checklist

## Migration

Replaced by:

- `tui/images-and-files`: Design image paste and file attachments for chat
- `tui/interrupt-and-steer`: Interrupt a running turn and immediately steer it
- `harness/goal-workflows`: Explore goal completion and bounded loop workflows

Attachment work is merged with image paste from default. Existing image reading is treated as a starting point to investigate, not a new feature request.
